{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1284230/extras/d0083dc8401729a7fd3540d2dc56478e.avif?t=1594199948\" width=601 height=251 /></span><br>In <strong>Movie World</strong> you can build your own movie studio. Produce entertaining and glamorous movies. Research new technologies to keep up with the industry. Expand into series, compete with other studios, receive the awards, create franchises and prevail in the movie business.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1284230/extras/f77806084ce3a66561851a4ec6bc44e8.avif?t=1594199948\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><strong>Produce</strong> entertaining and glamorous movies. Learn to write a perfect script! Hire the main star and the director! Choose a movie theme from 16 different genres!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1284230/extras/fdf701c67bb99f70d236fd2bf9c03b26.avif?t=1594199948\" width=601 height=250 /></span><br>Keep a close eye on the market in the movie industry! It has a big impact on movie distribution in the later game. Produce good movies and series that will expand your <strong>market share</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1284230/extras/76e35df00e14777156ca9e8b17c35701.avif?t=1594199948\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><strong>Research</strong> new technology to keep up with the industry otherwise you will be left behind which will result in bad movie quality and box office.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1284230/extras/83aed705a4c2d654ae1f1618edf1168b.avif?t=1594199948\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><strong>M